grid is another function of 'display'.
'display-grid' allow moving element in two diemension whereas 'display-flex' only allow movement in one dimension at one time.
it is declared in parent element

it will help creating rows and columns which will directly help to adjust elements adjusting items inside a 'cell'.

'grid-template-columns: ' helps in creating columns (after semicolon size of column acc to required no. of columns can we given)
'grid-template-rows: ' helps in creating rows (after semicolon size of column acc to required no. of columns can we given)

'justify-item': helps in adjusting element inside cell in x-direction inside a single cell/element/child
'align-item': helps in adjusting element inside cell in y-direction inside a single cell/element/child

'justify-self':used to aligh items 

'justify-content': used to align items in x-direction, basically used for parent div
'align-content': used to align items in y-direction, basically used for parent div